{title: Jesus, the Very Thought of Thee}
{artist: Bernard of Clairvaux · tr. Edward Caswall}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 72}

Verse 1
[G]Jesus, the [C]very [G]thought of [Em]thee with [C]sweetness [G]fills my [D]breast,
but [G]sweeter [C]far thy [G]face to [Em]see, and [C]in thy [D]presence [G]rest.
